{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-f3551743d1ee0551ad69","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"이야기 좀 할 수 있을까?","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["5606018528854630152","5309516308587642242","272049092394998357"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-8d3f5fcd72e6c46a14b0","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"물론이지, 째깍! 시계 소년은 친구에게 아는 걸 전부 말해줄 거야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5048707962238787493"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-2533406a6a9b15c5d1dd","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"좋은꿈 마을에 대해 이야기하자","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7873128416236347244"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-ff47e2e28ae6dfa85a4a","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"좋은꿈 마을, 째깍! 아름답고 평화로운 마을이지, 째깍! 나랑 내 친구들은 이곳에서 아무 근심 없이 즐겁게 살고 있어, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6512480805619535102"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-672e76bec456a3edc0d9","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"그런데——사악한 스톤 보스가 마을을 짓는 석재를 노리고 있어. 그 악당은 자기가 마을 주인의 후손이라면서 모두를 쫓아내려고 하고 있지, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2330775172859687706"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-fd139a5fe9aa7cdf7808","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"하지만 걱정하지 마, 친구! 나와 내 친구들이 절대 그의 사악한 뜻대로 되게 두지 않을 거야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2522059739575246952"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-0d5b5a1410db09d813ec","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"네 친구에 대해 이야기하자","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["8496704046756163426"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-98763b689c8f46627bb3","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"내 친구들은 다들 엄청 재미있는 녀석들이야——","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16507852731158137683"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-800fa33808370167cf47","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"하누 형제는 나의 가장 든든한 동료인데, 난 항상 안심하고 그에게 내 뒤를 맡길 수 있어, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9689650196236218936"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-1edd4353797cf2fac706","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"부엉이 선생님과 종이새들은 이 마을을 지었는데, 마치 마을을 자기 둥지처럼 아끼지, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10310197808896468226"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-9dc35022c6d8e4ba7b76","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"그리고 음표 아가씨, 거울 공주, 나무 어르신, 햄스터볼 기사… 날 믿어, 친구! 너도 나처럼 그들이 마음에 들 거야, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10879801529452430178"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-b1269e9f23dc4da5c15c","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"좋아, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16241753991322448644"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-5e402d98476f1f15ef56","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"나중에 보자!","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2631147818016569920"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-461512f32abf23310da5","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","text":"잊지 마, 친구! 시계 소년이 언제든 널 도와줄게, 째깍!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14768425932457090294"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p11525","title":"「시계 소년」","page":"「钟表小子」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-f3551743d1ee0551ad69","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-f3551743d1ee0551ad69","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"sfab3d5db53984b2a","scene":"NPC 대사 2","contextId":"wiki-context-2d2a0beb4ca60fbac6bcbd55","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,0,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["d9aab842afde-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p11525-8d3f